===============================================================================
DATA & MODEL ATTRIBUTIONS
===============================================================================

The pre-indexed bibliographic metadata and abstract snippets in `corpus_data.js`
and their corresponding vector embeddings in `semantic_engine.js` are derived
from the following publicly available conference archives and open-source models.
Original copyright in the individual abstracts, titles, and proceedings remains
with their respective authors and publishers:

1. eResearch Australasia Conference Corpus (2010–2026; 2,512 records)
   - Source: Australasian eResearch Organisations (AeRO) / eResearch Australasia
   - URL: https://conference.eresearch.edu.au/
   - Legacy Archive: https://eresearchau.files.wordpress.com/
   - Attribution: Titles, presenters, and abstract excerpts from the eResearch
     Australasia conference programs (2010–2026).

2. NeurIPS Proceedings Metadata (2010–2025; 26,987 records)
   - Source: Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS) Foundation
   - URL: https://papers.nips.cc/ and https://neurips.cc/
   - Attribution: Paper titles, author lists, years, and publication tracks
     from the Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems proceedings.

3. ACM/IEEE Supercomputing (SC) Proceedings Metadata (SC10–SC25; 2,279 records)
   - Source: International Conference for High Performance Computing, Networking,
     Storage, and Analysis (ACM / IEEE Computer Society) & DBLP Computer Science
     Bibliography (https://dblp.org/, CC0 1.0 Public Domain Dedication)
   - URL: https://sc25.supercomputing.org/ and https://dl.acm.org/conference/sc
   - Attribution: Paper titles, author lists, publication years, tracks, and DOIs.

4. Pre-trained Embedding Models & Software
   - sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (Apache-2.0 License)
     https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2
   - Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 & Transformers.js by Hugging Face / Joshua Lochner (Apache-2.0 License)
     https://huggingface.co/Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2
     https://github.com/xenova/transformers.js
   - Inspired by SemanticFinder by Dominik Weckmüller (MIT License)
     https://github.com/do-me/SemanticFinder
